@startuml
[*] --> User Arrives
User Arrives -> PIN Check : Card Inserted
PIN Check -> PIN Check : Incorrect PIN (up to 3 times)
PIN Check -> Menu Display : Correct PIN
PIN Check -> Card Retained : Invalid card or too many incorrect PINs
Card Retained -> Card Returned : Cancel Operation
Menu Display -> Processing Request : Select Option
Processing Request --> [*] : Request processed
@enduml
